        "text": "Garrick says it quietly, like a man setting down something heavy. *\"There's one more. A fifth Stone — she wrote about it.\"*\n\nAnd she did. Her footnote from the Blackglass, the one she wrote off: *\"Five, the fragment says... A poet's count, perhaps.\"*",
